    <item>
      <title>CDPR 同步开发《巫师 4》多平台版本，避免重蹈赛博朋克主机崩坏覆辙</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260830/CDPR-%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%B7%AB%E5%B8%88-4%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E9%87%8D%E8%B9%88%E8%B5%9B%E5%8D%9A%E6%9C%8B%E5%85%8B%E4%B8%BB%E6%9C%BA%E5%B4%A9%E5%9D%8F%E8%A6%86%E8%BE%99/</link>
